5,Exploring the Rich Soundscape of Congolese Music Heritage,https://shoutsmusic.blog/the-democratic-republic-of-the-congo-is-renowned-for-its-music/,"July 25, 2025 - Electric guitars, synthesizers, drums, cajons (box-shaped percussion instruments), keyboards, lokole (slit drums), and likembe (lamellophones) add a stylish touch to this music while preserving its cultural origins. The DR Congolese music scene is incredibly diverse and dynamic, encompassing various music styles and genres.",Likuba,Niger-Congo
